// CV-only copy: the bullet-level detail the PDF carries and the site does not.
//
// Everything that is a *fact* — name, role, company names, job titles, dates,
// education, languages — lives in en.strings and is shared with the site, so a
// title or a date cannot say one thing on jc-root.xyz and another in the PDF.
// test/cv.test.mjs enforces that split: a key that belongs in en.strings is
// refused here.
//
// Bullets are pipe-separated, the same convention stack_core_items already
// uses. Order is the order they render in.

// Section headings
"cv_heading_summary" = "SUMMARY";
