// Header. The email is never in this repository — it arrives as CONTACT_EMAIL
// at build time and is the one value in the CV that the catalog does not hold.
"cv_passport" = "Spanish passport";

// Summary. Longer and more formal than the site's about_body on purpose: a CV
// is read cold by someone who has not seen the site.
"cv_summary" = "Senior iOS Engineer with 6+ years of professional experience designing, building, and modernizing high-performance iOS and macOS applications using Swift, SwiftUI, and UIKit. Strong expertise in atomic design systems, performance optimization, GraphQL, automated testing, and CI/CD. I take full ownership of features from concept to release and mentor engineers on modern architecture. Recently expanded into AI agentic workflows, full-stack IoT systems, and hardware-software integration.";

