"cv_exp1_bullets" = "Design, build, and ship custom iOS applications end-to-end for private clients, owning the full lifecycle from architecture through release.|Publish and maintain two App Store products: Tapper Counters (SwiftUI 6, multilanguage) and MythLog (macOS, security-focused).|Integrate AI and agentic workflows into production apps and tooling (Claude, OpenAI, xAI APIs; local models via Ollama).|Architect and own Living Root (github.com/Living-Root): SwiftUI client with SwiftData snapshots for offline dashboard reads, Vapor + PostgreSQL backend serving a session-authenticated admin console, MicroPython/ESP32 firmware.|Extend that ownership into hardware, completing a formal Hydroponics Diploma at Anáhuac University (Feb–Jun 2026) and applying 3D printing to design custom sensor enclosures.";

"cv_exp2_bullets" = "Owned end-to-end delivery of features in The Home Depot's consumer iOS app, where shoppers pinpoint any item's exact aisle and bay location across US and Canada stores.|Drove performance and reliability at scale, building and optimizing real-time, high-volume data interfaces.|Raised code quality and release stability by implementing comprehensive unit and UI automation testing strategies.";

