"cv_exp4_bullets" = "Drove the creation of a comprehensive atomic design system, raising the bar for UI consistency and reusability across the app.|Developed and shipped new features in UIKit and SwiftUI with seamless backend integration.|Partnered with PMs, designers, and cross-functional teams to improve user experience and app performance.|Ran A/B tests on feature changes to inform product and UX decisions.|Owned technical direction for the team, making key architecture calls (MVVM, Clean Architecture, Coordinators) and mentoring engineers to elevate overall code quality.";

"cv_exp5_bullets" = "Led the modernization of a decade-old iOS application, owning the SwiftUI migration end-to-end while preserving performance for a live, in-production app.|Made the call to rebuild the app's foundation on MVVM, Clean Architecture, and the Coordinator pattern, setting technical direction for the refactor.|Raised UI performance standards, building complex dynamic lists that handle 10,000+ items smoothly while delivering pixel-perfect, HIG-compliant SwiftUI interfaces.|Integrated GraphQL for data delivery, and WiFi-connected terminal hardware via custom connection managers.|Set a new bar for release quality, establishing automated UI testing (Robot Pattern + XCUITest) and cutting release cycles by 30% with GitHub Actions CI/CD.|Ran A/B tests and experiments to validate product decisions with real usage data.|Mentored and elevated junior engineers within an Agile environment, working alongside designers and stakeholders.";

